w, ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotaraRi": [{"id": "gotaraRi", "headword": "गोतरणि", "headword_slp1": "gotaraRi", "fold": "gotaraRi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तरणि a kind of flower, Buddh.; L.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotarpaRa": [{"id": "gotarpaRa", "headword": "गोतर्पण", "headword_slp1": "gotarpaRa", "fold": "gotarpaRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तर्पण n. anything arranged for the pleasure of cows, AV.Pariś. lxix, 7.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotalaja": [{"id": "gotallaja", "headword": "गोतल्लज", "headword_slp1": "gotallaja", "fold": "gotalaja", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तल्लज m. an excellent cow, Pāṇ. ii, 1, 66, Sch.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोतल्लजः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotallajaH"]}], "gota": [{"id": "gotA", "headword": "गोता", "headword_slp1": "gotA", "fold": "gota", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—ता f. ‘cowship’, (in dialect) a cow, Pat. Introd. 35; 97, and on Vārtt. 6.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotirTa": [{"id": "gotIrTa", "headword": "गोतीर्थ", "headword_slp1": "gotIrTa", "fold": "gotirTa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तीर्थ n. N. of a Tīrtha, Suśr. vi, 31, 6", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(गवां त्˚), BhP. iii, 1, 22.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotirTaka": [{"id": "gotIrTaka", "headword": "गोतीर्थक", "headword_slp1": "gotIrTaka", "fold": "gotirTaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तीर्थक m. with च्छेद, an oblique cut applied to fistula of the rectum, Suśr. iv, 8, 11.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotulya": [{"id": "gotulya", "headword": "गोतुल्य", "headword_slp1": "gotulya", "fold": "gotulya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—तुल्य m. ‘resembling an ox’, the Gayal, Gal.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotra": [{"id": "gotra", "headword": "गोत्र", "headword_slp1": "gotra", "fold": "gotra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—त्र॑ n. (√ त्रै) protection or shelter for cows, cow-pen, cow-shed, stable for cattle, stable (in general), hurdle, enclosure, RV. (once m., viii, 50, 10)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "‘family enclosed by the hurdle’, family, race, lineage, kin, ChUp.; ŚāṅkhŚr.; Kauś. &c. (a polysyllabic fem. in ई shortens this vowel before गोत्र in comp. [e.g. ब्राह्मणिगोत्रा, ‘a Brāhman woman only by descent or name’, Kāś.] Pāṇ. vi, 3, 43 ff.)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the family name, ĀśvGṛ.; MBh. xiii, 548; VarBṛS.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "name (in general), Śak. vi, 5; Ragh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(in Gr.) the grandson and his descendants if no older offspring of the same ancestor than this grandson lives (if the son lives the grandson is called युवन्), Pāṇ. ii, 4, 63; iv, 1, 89 ff. and 162 ff.; 2, 111 and 3, 80 and 126", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "an affix used for forming a patr. L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a tribe, subdivision (in the Brāhman caste 49 Gotras are reckoned and supposed to be sprung from and named after celebrated teachers, as Śāṇḍilya, Kaśyapa, Gautama, Bharad-vāja, &c.), W.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a genus, class, species, W.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a multitude, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "increase, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "possession, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a forest, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a field, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "an umbrella or parasol, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "knowledge of probabilities, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गो—त्र॑ (अस्), m. a mountain (a meaning probably derived fr. -भि॑द्), BhP. ii, iii, vi", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a cloud (cf. -भि॑द्), Naigh. i, 10", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a road, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गो-त्र॑ &c. See ib., col. 3.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्रं", "गोत्रः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotraM", "gotraH"]}, {"id": "gotrA", "headword": "गोत्रा", "headword_slp1": "gotrA", "fold": "gotra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो॑—त्रा (आ), f. a herd of kine, Pāṇ. iv, 2, 51", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the earth, L. (cf. गोत्रेश)", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotram": [{"id": "gotram", "headword": "गोत्रम्", "headword_slp1": "gotram", "fold": "gotram", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो॑—त्रम् (अम्), ind. after a verb denoting repetition and implying a blame, Pāṇ. viii, 1, 27 and 57", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotreRa": [{"id": "gotreRa", "headword": "गोत्रेण", "headword_slp1": "gotreRa", "fold": "gotreRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो॑—त्रेण (एण), ind. instr. with regard to one's family name g. प्रकृत्य्-आदि", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotrakartf": [{"id": "gotrakartf", "headword": "गोत्रकर्तृ", "headword_slp1": "gotrakartf", "fold": "gotrakartf", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो॑—त्र॑—कर्तृ m. the founder of a family, MBh. xiii, 248", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotrakarin": [{"id": "gotrakArin", "headword": "गोत्रकारिन्", "headword_slp1": "gotrakArin", "fold": "gotrakarin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—त्र—कारिन् mfn. founding a family, Pravar.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotrakila": [{"id": "gotrakIlA", "headword": "गोत्रकीला", "headword_slp1": "gotrakIlA", "fold": "gotrakila", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गो—त्र—कीला f. (= अचल-क्˚) the earth, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gotraksanti": [{"id": "gotrakzAnti", "headword": "गोत्रक्षान्ति", "headword_slp1": "gotrakzAn